# Google OAuth client ID for the Calendar API (chrome.identity).
# This is a PUBLIC client identifier, not a secret — it ships in the built
# extension manifest. It's kept here only for config hygiene / per-environment
# swaps. It must be a "Chrome Extension" OAuth client whose Item ID is the
# pinned extension ID (nblafpggejpkjeelebiigcdghkceknea).
#
# Copy this file to .env and fill in the value:
#   cp apps/extension/.env.example apps/extension/.env
GOOGLE_OAUTH_CLIENT_ID=
